multi={{"Consecration","Now worth its Mana: your main way to hit several."},{"Retribution Aura","Hurts everything that hits you."},{"Holy Wrath","Packs of undead or demons."},{"Judgement/Holy Strike","On one target at a time as usual."}},
},
{role="dps",name="Dungeon and raid damage (Retribution)",plan="paladin-retribution-raid",l1="One enemy",l2="Several enemies",
single={{"Seal of the Crusader","Before the pull, then judge it first."},{"Judgement","On cooldown."},{"Seal of Command","Keep it up."},{"Seal of Righteousness","At 3 stacks of Unsealed Wrath's echo, swap to it for a swing, then back."},{"Holy Strike","On cooldown."},{"Consecration","Keep it down while Mana lasts."},{"Exorcism","Undead and demons."}},
multi={{"Consecration","First, once the tank has them."},{"Holy Wrath","Undead or demon packs."},{"Holy Strike/Judgement","On the tank's target."}},
},
